        <mxCell id="envt" parent="envs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;overflow=fill;" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;5&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#F1F5F9&quot;&gt;&lt;th&gt;Ambiente&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Onde corre&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Entrada&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEV&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;branch dev&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Docker Compose&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;http://localhost:8000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;STG&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;branch stg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;MicroK8s&lt;br&gt;ns &lt;i&gt;staging&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;port-forward&lt;br&gt;(sem exposição externa)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;PRD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;branch main&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;MicroK8s&lt;br&gt;ns &lt;i&gt;production&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Ingress &lt;b&gt;HTTPS&lt;/b&gt; :443&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="390" x="15" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="envn" parent="envs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Princípios de desenho&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Um único ponto de entrada em PRD, em HTTPS&lt;br&gt;• Isolamento por namespace (aplicação, identidade, observabilidade)&lt;br&gt;• Tráfego bloqueado por omissão (NetworkPolicies)&lt;br&gt;• Identidade centralizada (Keycloak / OIDC)&lt;br&gt;• Telemetria transversal a todos os serviços&lt;br&gt;• A imagem validada em STG é a que corre em PRD (sem novo build nem testes em PRD)&lt;br&gt;• PRD com réplicas, auto-scaling e health-checks" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="390" x="15" y="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
