        <mxCell id="rt" parent="ns" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Encaminhamento do Ingress (PRD)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/&lt;/b&gt; → Web &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;/users&lt;/b&gt; → Service Users &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;/orders&lt;/b&gt; → Service Orders &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;login (token)&lt;/b&gt; → Keycloak&lt;br&gt;Todos os Services são ClusterIP: nada é exposto fora do Ingress. A consola do Keycloak, o Grafana, o Prometheus e o Jaeger não são expostos." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;">
